<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχρό-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>coldness, cold,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμότης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				437e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ περιέχοντος ψ. καὶ στυγνότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.21.1
				</span></i>
			: pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχρότητες</span>”
				<i>chills, frosts,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.701b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. of
			persons, <i>want of feeling, bad taste,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.256
			</span></i>: <i>sluggishness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			exaggerated, glittering phrases and the like ,
				<i>frigidity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
